      "summary": "Negotiations are ongoing for an 11-acre parcel owned by the Newport-Mesa Unified School District (NMUSD) adjacent to the Randall Preserve, with competing proposals for its future. A developer is bidding to lease the land for nearly 200 housing units, while community advocates, including the Coastal Corridor Alliance, are pushing for its preservation as public open space, integrated with the nature preserve.",
